      "comment" : "Add course: saves the course again after a failure.\nAdd score: reads the courses again after a failure.\nAdd score: saves the score again after a failure.\nAll players: reads the players again.\nAll rounds: reads the rounds again.\nHole play: reads the round again.\nHome error banner's retry button.\nNew round: reads the players and course again.\nPlayer card: reads the player again.\nRetries loading data after an error.\nRound complete: reads the round again.\nRound detail: reads the round again.\nScorecard: reads the round again."
    },
